  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On Shang clan city’s battle stage, Li Hao fields a giant toad that is larger than a mammoth, grey-skinned with moss and tiny rocks on its surface, millstone-sized eyes, and a swollen back that carries a real hill of mountain rocks about ten and a half feet high, complete with grass, weeds, and a few trees. It is the rank three Gu mountain back toad.",
        "chapters": [
          289
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_li_hao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Li Hao’s true core in the match against Fang Yuan is that same pair.",
        "chapters": [
          291
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "position-swap-gu-combination",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Position Swap Gu lets him trade places with the toad (or with an opponent), covering the toad’s slow movement and dropping its crash onto a target that has no time to dodge.",
        "chapters": [
          289
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "position-swap-gu-combination",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Spectators call the combination unbeatable until Fang Yuan ignores Li Hao and keeps attacking the toad, burning Li Hao’s primeval essence through repeated swaps and healing attempts.",
        "chapters": [
          289
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "position-swap-gu-combination",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Cited chapters name no other owner.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "position-swap-gu-combination",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan later batters Zhu Ba on the same stage circuit, beast phantoms flash above him in a reappearance of the scene when he beat the mountain back toad. The toad itself does not return; the reappearance is only a visual recall of that earlier victory.",
        "chapters": [
          299
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "stage-fight-recall",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_zhu_ba"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
